Package: vst-kiosk
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv
Maintainer: VirtuSense Technologies Inc. <support@virtusense.com>
Description: VST Sentry Kiosk Display
 Stateless fall-prevention alert display for VA hospital nurse stations.
 Connects to VST Server via WebSocket and displays real-time room status
 and patient fall alerts on wall-mounted monitors.
